{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"This is a selected classification-route predicate for the assessed Fund, not an assessment of distribution compliance or every rule capable of making a product complex.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessed Fund is distinguished from intermediary funds, securities, derivatives and underlying borrowers. Its own authorisation and LAF status determine scope.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"All facts concern the same assessment occasion. No measurement date or current-versus-permitted exposure convention is inferred.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The threshold fact remains unknown until a defensible exposure basis and adequate evidence are available. The non-exhaustive instrument examples do not themselves quantify exposure.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The designation fact concerns an operative SFC decision, not a prediction from risk factors, distributor ratings, authorisation scrutiny or consultation.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.bcbaf48b0c00369eac79c2cb.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A false scope result excludes this selected control only. A false route result does not establish non-complex status under other rules or resolve persistence of a previous threshold-based classification.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"e2f878be8e8a03a1d6ae9ce37f9b7aaaaf092f58f634b85cc264790e9823de3d","candidate_id":"candidate.48961eb89ae74af69378336ee90de3aa","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an in-scope Fund, true means at least one stated classification route is satisfied at the assessment occasion: aggregate direct and indirect private-market exposure is at least 50% of NAV, including exactly 50%, or an operative SFC case-specific designation applies. The Fund must consequently be treated as complex for distribution under this selected control. False means both stated routes are established to be absent at that occasion; it does not establish non-complex status under other rules or decide whether an earlier threshold-based classification persists. Missing facts remain unknown unless a known satisfied route determines the result. This predicate does not evaluate compliance with resulting sale requirements.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"SHARED_RESOLUTION","issue_ids":["issue.ad6c8526c24540bab698d48c529743e8","issue.c409fc65988f45ed8d1a0964e708638e","issue.f086b5b042b44fc2a9b4e2af0266bc20","issue.baf1aec0f7f446399d9d81d342bf31f0","issue.cfb85d40cfba4055b59b4b3cd864d84c","issue.a7137e9561704661bc7f7c674b8842cb"],"parent_id":"candidate.f4e0f2fb95ee40a8925471ad17e338f2","probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"The scope-and-definition challenge supports refining the parent, not adding a rival threshold rule. The assessed Fund, its manager, the SFC, distributors and intermediary instruments have distinct roles. A listed BDC can transmit private-market exposure without its listed or closed-ended form excluding the investing Fund; the LAF exception concerns the assessed Fund itself. A direct-only or listed-instrument exclusion hypothesis fails against the express inclusion of indirect exposure. A mandate-based rival is suggested by prospective disclosure examples but not established as a classification calculation rule. The strongest unresolved issue is how to quantify indirect exposure, especially mixed underlying pools and derivatives; adopting full position value or proportional look-through would manufacture an executable rule absent supporting authority. The supplied incomparable-binding diagnostics contain no substantive counterexample. Fact bindings therefore remain stable with the parent.","run_id":"run.08f45e4d9030408999f87203f067aefc","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"be86c12a28ac1c552b9cc386dfa44174629a63a786068d9bf5d8cdb44cbfa056","source_unit_ids":["d4148dd852cee.u1.5","d4148dd852cee.u14.2516","d4148dd852cee.u15.2718","d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","d4148dd852cee.u32.4805","d4148dd852cee.u4.564","d4148dd852cee.u46.6668","d4148dd852cee.u49.6955","d4148dd852cee.u59.7979","d4148dd852cee.u60.8163","d4148dd852cee.u63.8691","d4148dd852cee.u64.8910"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Selected control: stated complex-product classification routes for the assessed Fund under the retained circular"}